From: tallbiscuits <112773728+tallbiscuits@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 15:35:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] G-code viewer: no live tracking

The printer prints its own copy of the file, without the comments, so
virtual_sdcard.file_position doesn't point into the file the viewer
loaded, and the tracking falls further behind as the print goes on.

diff --git a/src/components/gcodeviewer/Viewer.vue b/src/components/gcodeviewer/Viewer.vue
index 55d3639..98c80d4 100644
--- a/src/components/gcodeviewer/Viewer.vue
+++ b/src/components/gcodeviewer/Viewer.vue
@@ -441,7 +441,9 @@ export default class Viewer extends Mixins(BaseMixin) {
     }
 
     get showTrackingButton() {
-        return this.printerIsPrinting && this.sdCardFilePath === this.loadedFile
+        // Halyard: the printer prints its own copy, without the comments, so file_position
+        // doesn't point into the file loaded here, and tracking would fall behind.
+        return false
     }
 
     get printing_objects(): PrintableObject[] {
